   "type": "text",
   "text": "Is there someplace I can find an archive of your art? I  checked the website but I didn't see an archive there :( I know some are on Twitter, but you have to scroll past a ton of stuff to get to it and I was just wondering if there was a more convenient way to find it? Thank you and your beautiful face 🙏"
